eration.\\nEach generation outputs 2 images by default.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.018 per generation in Standard mode and ~$0.022 per generation in Quality mode.\"},{\"model\":\"gemini-3-pro\",\"slug\":\"gemini-3-pro\",\"title\":\"Gemini 3 Pro\",\"provider\":\"Google\",\"taskType\":[\"Chat\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"Input 100 credits / 1M tokens (≈ $0.50), Output 700 credits / 1M tokens (≈ $3.50). Both are ~70–75% cheaper than official pricing.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.45 for Input 1M tokens and ~$3.15 for Output 1M tokens.\"},{\"model\":\"nano-banana-pro\",\"slug\":\"nano-banana-pro\",\"title\":\"Nano Banana Pro\",\"provider\":\"Google\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Image\",\"Image to Image\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"18 credits (~$0.09) for 1K/2K and 24 credits (~$0.12) for 4K—flat rate up to 50 % below official pricing.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.082 for 1K/2K and ~$0.11 for 4K.\"},{\"model\":\"flux-2/pro-text-to-image\",\"slug\":\"flux-2/pro-text-to-image\",\"title\":\"Flux 2 Pro Text To Image\",\"provider\":\"Black Forest Labs\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Image\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"5 credits (~$0.025) for 1K or 7 credits (~$0.035) for 2K—upload up to 8 reference images at no extra cost; you already save 40 %+ versus official pricing on a single image, and the advantage only grows with more uploads.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.0225 for 1K and ~$0.0315 for 2K.\"},{\"model\":\"flux-2/flex-text-to-image\",\"slug\":\"flux-2/flex-text-to-image\",\"title\":\"Flux 2 Flex Text To Image\",\"provider\":\"Black Forest Labs\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Image\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"14 credits (~$0.07) for 1K or 24 credits (~$0.12) for 2K—upload up to 8 reference images at no extra cost; you already save 40 %+ versus official pricing on a single image, and the advantage only grows with more uploads.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to~$0.063 for 1K  and ~$0.108 for 2K.\"},{\"model\":\"flux-2/pro-image-to-image\",\"slug\":\"flux-2/pro-image-to-image\",\"title\":\"Flux 2 Pro Image To Image\",\"provider\":\"Black Forest Labs\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Image\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"5 credits (~$0.025) for 1K or 7 credits (~$0.035) for 2K—upload up to 8 reference images at no extra cost; you already save 40 %+ versus official pricing on a single image, and the advantage only grows with more uploads.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.023 for 1K and ~$0.032 for 2K.\"},{\"model\":\"flux-2/flex-image-to-image\",\"slug\":\"flux-2/flex-image-to-image\",\"title\":\"Flux 2 Flex Image To Image\",\"provider\":\"Black Forest Labs\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Image\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"14 credits (~$0.07) for 1K or 24 credits (~$0.12) for 2K—upload up to 8 reference images at no extra cost; you already save 40 %+ versus official pricing on a single image, and the advantage only grows with more uploads.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.063 for 1K and ~$0.11 for 2K.\"},{\"model\":\"kling-2.6/text-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling-2.6/text-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling 2.6 Text To Video\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Video\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"HD video 5 s no-audio 55 credits ($0.28) / 10 s no-audio 110 credits ($0.55); with audio—5 s 110 credits ($0.55) or 10 s 220 credits ($1.10)—flat-rate about 20 % below the official price.\\nHigh-tier top-ups (+10% bonus) bring effective pricing down to ~$0.25 per 5 s no-audio, ~$0.50 per 10 s no-audio; with audio—5 s ~$0.50, 10 s ~$1.00.\"},{\"model\":\"kling-2.6/image-to-video\",\"slug\":\"kling-2.6/image-to-video\",\"title\":\"Kling 2.6 Image To Video\",\"provider\":\"Kling\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\"],\"description\":