mage (≈ $0.06), while WAN-2.7 Image costs 4.8 credits per image (≈ $0.024). \\nHigh-tier top-ups include +10% bonus credits. Effective pricing is approximately 10% lower than the above rates.\"},{\"model\":\"wan/2-7-image-pro\",\"slug\":\"wan/2-7-image-pro\",\"title\":\"Wan 2.7 Image Pro\",\"provider\":\"Wan\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Image\",\"Image to Image\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"WAN-2.7 Image Pro costs 12 credits per image (≈ $0.06), while WAN-2.7 Image costs 4.8 credits per image (≈ $0.024). \\nHigh-tier top-ups include +10% bonus credits. Effective pricing is approximately 10% lower than the above rates.\"},{\"model\":\"bytedance/seedance-2\",\"slug\":\"bytedance/seedance-2\",\"title\":\"Seedance 2.0\",\"provider\":\"ByteDance\",\"taskType\":[\"Image to Video\",\"Video to Video\",\"Text to Video\"],\"description\":\"\",\"pricingDesc\":\"480P: 11.5 credits/s ($0.0575/s, with video) | 19 credits/s ($0.095/s, no video)\\n720P: 25 credits/s ($0.125/s, with video) | 41 credits/s ($0.205/s, no video)\\n1080P : 62 credits/s ($0.31/s, with video) | 102 credits/s ($0.51/s, no video).\\n4K:  128 credits/s ($0.64/s, with video) | 208 credits/s ($1.04/s, no video)\\n\\n\\uD83D\\uDD38Note\\uD83D\\uDD38: “With video input” has a lower unit price due to a different calculation method: No video = Price × Output;  With video = Price × (Input + Output)\\n\\nHigh-tier top-ups include a +10% bonus, making effective pricing approximately 10% lower than listed. Prices are currently in beta and may be adjusted in the future\"},{\"model\":\"bytedance/seedance-2-fast\",\"slug\":\"bytedance/seedance-2-fast\",\"title\":\"Seedance 2.0 Fast\",\"provider\":\"ByteDance\",\"taskType\":[\"Text to Video\",\"Image to Video\",\"Video to Video\"],\"description\":null,\"pricingDesc\":\"480P: 6.8 credits/s ($0.034/s, with video) | 11.7 credits/s ($0.059/s, no video)\\n720P: 15 credits/s ($0.075/s, with video) | 24.8 credits/s ($0.124/s, no video)\\n\\n\\uD83D\\uDD38Note\\uD83D\\uDD